	(text_box "Notes:\n\nThe module contains STM32WB55VGY\nIt includes clocks and a chip antenna\n\nDecoupling capacitors are part of the module\n\nPE3 and PC8 connectedd to GND to allow for a\ngrounding pin to reach ground. Set them up as\nINPUTS.\n\nPA0 as a WKUP pin"
